  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the garlic minced
  - Chop the onion minced
  - Chop the ginger sliced
  - Chop the beef shanks sliced
  - Chop the pork kidney sliced
  - Chop beef tripe to sliced
  - Chop the beef to sliced
  - Chop the pork intestine to sliced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pot on the stove
  - Add 1 tsp of cooking oil
  - Add 1 tsp of cooking oil
  - Add the minced garlic
  - Add the julienned ginger
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add the sliced beef shanks
  - Add the sliced beef tripe
  - Add the sliced pork intestine
  - Add the sliced kidney
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add 1/2 cup of vinegar
  - Cover it with pan lid until simmer
  - Add 1 tsp of achuete powder
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
  - Add Water
  - Turn the stove to medium heat
  - Cover it with pan lid to simmer
  - Add 1/4 tsp of salt
  - Add 1/4 tsp of pepper
  - "Saut\xE9 using the spatula"
